WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Akuma answers Ryu’s Drive Impact with his own.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.400
Standing heavy kick connects during the crumple.

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:04.950
Crouching medium punch links after the heavy kick.

4
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.000
A second crouching medium punch leads into Tatsu.

5
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.800
Medium Tatsu carries Ryu away.

6
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.150
Ryu recovers after the midscreen conversion.
